ure is compromised\n- It exploits White's undeveloped position (king still on e1, pieces not coordinated)\n- It seizes the initiative before White can consolidate their advanced knights\n- The check tempo allows Black to dictate the flow of the game\n\n**Answer:** Q: d8-h4"}
